Output docs/vhs/out/10-vim-mode-editing.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+W Type "," Enter Escape Type "/delete" Enter Enter Sleep 500ms
Type "A/v2" Escape Type "0wdw" Sleep 800ms Type "u" Sleep 800ms Type ":w" Enter Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Q
